Rampsmith

Welcome to Rampsmith
====================

Rampsmith is now installed on Example Outfitters. It finds WCAG 2.2 AA
failures in your store and fixes them at the source, in your own store data
and theme code, with a dated record of every change.

What happens next
-----------------

- Your first scan is running. It checks your main page types and their
  interactive states, such as menus and the cart drawer.
- When it finishes, Rampsmith emails you the results, ranked by their effect
  on shoppers.
- Fixes that need no code, such as image descriptions, wait for your
  approval. Nothing changes in your store until you approve it.

Open Rampsmith:
https://admin.shopify.com/store/fixture-store/apps/rampsmith

| Automated checks find only part of all accessibility issues. Rampsmith
| lists what it checked and what still needs a person to review.
|
| Deque, the maker of axe-core, reports that axe-core finds on average 57%
| of WCAG issues automatically.

